- Hardened Microsoft Entra conditional access for macOS hosts. The Platform SSO profile must now allow `com.fleetdm.orbit` in `ExtensionData` > `AppAllowList`; until it does, Fleet doesn't report the host's compliance to Intune. After upgrading, macOS hosts report their Entra device ID again on their next check-in.
- For Microsoft Entra conditional access, an Entra device ID can now belong to only one host. To move it to another host (for example, after re-enrolling a device as a new host), delete the old host in Fleet.
